---
<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="info-grid">
            <div class="info-content">
                <h2 class="section-title">Register a Moroccan .ma Domain</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Registering a .ma domain is a powerful way to secure your brand in the digital landscape. Our streamlined process ensures you get online quickly and securely.</p>
                
                <ul class="advantages-list">
                    <li>
                        <div class="icon-box">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>ANRT-Compliant Process</strong>
                            <p>Full adherence to the Agence Nationale de Réglementation des Télécommunications guidelines.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="icon-box">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Fast Activation</strong>
                            <p>Experience instant setup and get your domain up and running without long verification delays.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="icon-box">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 8 6 6"></path><path d="m4 14 6-6 2-3"></path><path d="M2 5h12"></path><path d="M7 2h1"></path><path d="m22 22-5-10-5 10"></path><path d="M14 18h6"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Multilingual Support</strong>
                            <p>Expert assistance available in Arabic, French, and English every step of the way.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="info-image">
                <!-- Using a colored placeholder to keep minimal aesthetic without images -->
                <div class="decorative-box">
                    <div class="inner-element"></div>
                    <div class="inner-element-2"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .info-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 4rem;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .advantages-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .advantages-list li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .icon-box {
        background-color: rgba(81, 112, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .advantages-list strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .advantages-list p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .decorative-box {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-bg-alt) 0%, #eef1ff 100%);
        border-radius: var(--border-radius);
        height: 400px;
        width: 100%;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .inner-element {
        position: absolute;
        width: 200px;
        height: 200px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--color-primary);
        opacity: 0.1;
        top: -50px;
        right: -50px;
    }

    .inner-element-2 {
        position: absolute;
        width: 300px;
        height: 300px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--color-primary);
        opacity: 0.05;
        bottom: -100px;
        left: -100px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .info-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .decorative-box {
            display: none;
        }
    }
</style>
